{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13759","headline":"杜秀才画立走水牛歌 · 顾况","name":"杜秀才画立走水牛歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"崑仑儿，骑白象，时时锁着师子项。\n奚奴跨马不搭鞍，立走水牛惊汉官。\n江村小儿好夸骋，脚踏牛头上牛领。\n浅草平田攃过时，大虫着钝几落井。\n杜生知我恋沧州，画作一障张牀头。\n八十老婆拍手笑，妬他织女嫁牵牛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13759.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13759","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}